    "mutation_reconcile_route_rationale": "CF-P6-001 finding: the outbox cannot resolve a lost response without it. ADR-006 requires a retry past the 30-day window to reconcile before creating a new mutation ID, and sprint gate scenarios G5/G6 are unverifiable without a way to ask whether a mutation applied. The initial plan listed seven routes and omitted it.",
